WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.710
 I've put together a team.

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:04.710
It's me, you, and the big guy.

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:06.360
 No, no team.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:07.641
Only Hulk.

00:00:07.641 --> 00:00:11.078
[FIGHTING SOUNDS]

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:21.296
 Now go be a hero.

00:00:21.296 --> 00:00:24.712
[ROARING AND SMASHING SOUNDS]

00:00:28.616 --> 00:00:32.032
[GRUNTING]

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:39.640
 You just can't go around
throwing shields at people.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:40.890
You could have killed them.

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:42.830
 Sorry, I just get
so angry all the time.

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:46.100
[GRUNT] So many stairs.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:47.700
 You were one of the
Avengers, one of the team,

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:48.840
one of, one of our friends.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:49.980
This is what friends do.

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:50.910
They support each other.

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.200
 We're locked down out here.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.630
 When he gets Banner,
time for a lullaby.

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:57.333
 Hey, big guy.

00:00:57.333 --> 00:00:58.300
 The sun's getting real low.

00:01:04.048 --> 00:01:05.006
 Ahh.

00:01:05.006 --> 00:01:06.930
[GRUNTING]

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:11.764
 Just for once in
your life, don't smash.

00:01:11.764 --> 00:01:18.980
[PUNCHING]

00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:19.880
 Come out.

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:20.750
Come out.

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:21.780
Come out.

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:23.250
No.

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:27.030
I put the brains and the brawn
together, and now they get me.

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:32.630
 Let's finish the job.

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:37.560
 Guys.

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:40.790
 I see this as an absolute win.

